2026/11/02 10:22:37 DEBUG : pacer: low level retry 1/1 (error operation error S3: PutObject, exceeded maximum number of attempts, 1, https response error StatusCode: 0, R
2026/11/02 10:22:37 DEBUG : lecture-100MB.bin: Received error: operation error S3: PutObject, exceeded maximum number of attempts, 1, https response error StatusCode: 0, 
